# Frontend scope

You are working in the Angular frontend. Follow `life-value-finance/AGENTS.md` for full rules.

Key constraints:
- Signals-first state; OnPush; lazy routes
- No direct `localStorage` — use storage abstraction services in `core/storage/`
- Financial calculations live in `core/domain/` — keep UI decoupled
- Preserve API contracts with `backend/` unless explicitly asked to change them
- Run from `life-value-finance/`: `npm start` (SSR) or `ng serve` (:4200)
